{
  "title": "Pulse\u2013hemoglobin coupling does not establish incremental inflammation prediction across NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "In 4,122 NHANES 2005\u20132006 and 4,927 separately sampled 2007\u20132008 adults, adding centered radial pulse \u00d7 hemoglobin to flexible conventional predictors reduced validation log-CRP MSE by 0.000354 (0.033%); source-refit/target-PSU 95% interval [\u22120.002499, 0.006145]. Source cross-validation and several prespecified challenges worsened. Useful incremental prediction was not established.",
